      <title>LPL 2026赛季败者组决赛：AL 3:2淘汰iG，BP练阵容成焦点</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/game/post/20260912/LPL-2026%E8%B5%9B%E5%AD%A3%E8%B4%A5%E8%80%85%E7%BB%84%E5%86%B3%E8%B5%9BAL-32%E6%B7%98%E6%B1%B0iGBP%E7%BB%83%E9%98%B5%E5%AE%B9%E6%88%90%E7%84%A6%E7%82%B9/</link>
